																		Vulcan, the Disaster
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/t-rutherford" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4620432); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4620432&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608238311" alt="T Rutherford" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4620432)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/t-rutherford" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4620432); return false;" >T Rutherford</a></span> <span class="odate time_1562083252 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">02 Jul 2019 16:00</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4296620">
									

<hr />
<p><strong>Dondelinger:</strong> Now, I'm going to burn this donut to show you how many calories it has.<br />
<strong>Homer:</strong> NOOOOOOOOOOO!<br />
<strong>Dondelinger:</strong> The bright blue flame indicates this was a particularly sweet donut.<br />
<strong>Homer:</strong> This is not happening! This can not be happening&#8230; <em>[sobbing]</em>&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;Homer goes to College&quot; <em>The Simpsons</em>, October 14, 1993.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>EDIT:</strong> 250 upvotes in a month. Thank you so much everyone. I hope I can keep writing articles you enjoy!</p>
<p>My third article, after <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4228">Karma Kameleon</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4281">Stalled Conversation</a>. This one is a bit more&#8230; heavy.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">YOU&nbsp;WOULD&nbsp;DARE&nbsp;VIEW&nbsp;MY&nbsp;SPOILERS?</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">...&nbsp;I&nbsp;guess...&nbsp;that's&nbsp;fine...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The foundation contain a Volcano God for 3/4ths of a century with organic food, until by accident this being gets a taste for junk food, and demands more. Over time, it gets bigger, lazier, and less threatening, until it's not even a true threat, so long as we keep giving it the &quot;Couch Potato&quot; containment regimen.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>This was also my first foray with listpages, which alone makes it the most labor-intensive article I've written. It's also had the most reviews, revisions, and re-writes, but I think it was worth it!</p>
<p>Image sources are <a href="https://pixabay.com/photos/volcano-lava-rash-science-fiction-2876292/">here</a> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/douglastofoli/27904924041">here</a> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Volcanic_island_(2665431193).jpg">here</a> and <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lava_Lake_Nyiragongo_2.jpg">here</a>, all under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported license, or Pixbay free use license.</p>
<p>All locations (Moaha Island) and names within this article are works of fiction.</p>
<p>Special thanks to:<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564674479" alt="Ayers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1856789); return false;">Ayers</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4504036); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4504036&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564674479" alt="KindlyTurtleClem" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4504036)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kindlyturtleclem" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4504036); return false;">KindlyTurtleClem</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564674479" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1564674479" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3075960); return false;">stormbreath</a></span><br />
